hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 320
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ActorBorderColor #475569
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  NoteBorderColor #D4A000
}
legend bottom left
  <color:#16803C><b>GREEN [ENC]</b></color>  Encryption established for the named boundary; not a claim of complete security.
  <color:#DC2626><b>RED [PLAIN]</b></color>  Confirmed plaintext protocol or application-visible data; local vs network is labelled.
  <color:#D4A000><b>YELLOW [CHECK]</b></color>  Encryption with weak trust/authentication, or protection not established.
  Yellow takes precedence over green when a material weakness applies. Unknown does not mean unencrypted.
  Storage arrows describe persistence; memory arrows describe processing, not additional network requests.
endlegend
